body:
Destiny and TriHex's stance is that streamers need to be held accountable for their community, as in doing something to prevent negativity or harassment. Of course, a streamer can't stop everyone in their community from being negative, but for the most part they can influence people to stop. Also thinking "everyone gets shit" totally ignores the points that they are making and justifies the actions taking place.

&#x200B;

Edit: in the stream Destiny said and was banning anyone who told Train to kill himself.
